e not to get long  extensions you might say not only people  can grow their hair and while I'm not  talking to people who can't grow their  hair medical reasons I'm talking to the  girls who buy into transient beauty  trends inspired by people like the  Kardashians  we'll change their hair color and length  every month in today's culture when we  want something we want it now but hair  takes years to grow and it's that hard  work that makes it desirable in the  first place a lot of hard work is going  into hair extensions but it's for wrong  reasons I've done the work to grow my  hair long naturally and if you want long  hair then I think you should too if you  say your hair won't grow then stop  getting trims if you say you need to get  trims to cut off split ends then I'd  like you to know that what ends  eventually fall off by themselves anyway  by the time here gets this small all the  split ends have fallen off by themselves  so good luck
 

